OL,3,AWhite House says Melania Trump brokered
OL,4,Atruce for Ukraine city 'on brink of
OL,5,Adisaster'
OL,6,
OL,7,FOleshky was seized by Russia during the
OL,8,Ffirst days of its full-scale invasion
OL,9,Fin February 2022. Trapped between
OL,10,FUkrainian positions across the Dnipro
OL,11,FRiver and Russian forces to the east,
OL,12,Fresidents have recently resorted to
OL,13,Feating garden weeds to survive.
